WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,080
Idiot, you really think I'm an old fool who can't see through it

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:07,680
I want to lend my hand to get rid of Lou Niang. She can’t control her concubine by herself.

3
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:10,920
Instead, she wants me, who is not her biological mother, to clean up the mess for her.

4
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:13,480
When were you so sure that the thing was in Lou Niang’s yard?

5
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:17,240
I'm afraid they took advantage of the time just now and sent someone to put the evidence in.

6
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:21,880
Okay, now that you have set up the stage, I will sing with you

7
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:25,280
This design is related to Sun Xi, so Sun Xi cannot stay outdoors.

8
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:29,180
The sixth sister pretends to be a chivalrous person, but she also has real praises despite saying little.

9
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:32,540
Why was it that this one had a peach branch smeared on it?

10
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:37,220
Could it be that the person who poisoned me was so sure that Sixth Sister would bring this one yesterday?

11
00:00:37,220 --> 00:00:42,960
Ah Yue, you should have decided to wear this hairpin yesterday

12
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:47,250
When I mentioned this hairpin, I decided to wear this one

13
00:00:47,250 --> 00:00:49,380
Does anyone know

14
00:00:49,380 --> 00:00:54,310
The two maids beside me, cousin Qingyin, and her maid
